# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.94: kinds that map no key. Public.
format     conformance-held-nomap
version    0.94.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       json
kind    p
when    t  p
requires probe.x=1
kind    q
when    t  q
requires probe.y
kind    r
when    t  r
